@base = http://localhost:5188

### Frontend catalog (offline sample by default)
GET {{base}}/v1/catalog

### OpenAPI contract
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json

### Sanitized service list
GET {{base}}/v1/ai/services

### Source coverage (live mode seeds the 98-source registry)
GET {{base}}/v1/sources

### Pending human review
GET {{base}}/v1/review/items

### Provider execution metadata
GET {{base}}/v1/ai/executions
